CFFTest.sfd is a FontForge file for creating CFFTest.otf, a custom OpenType
font for testing the golang.org/x/image/font/sfnt package's CFF support.

fvarTest.py is a fontTools script for creating fvarTest.ttf and fvarTest.ttc,
a custom variable TrueType font (with wght and wdth axes and three named
instances) and a TrueType collection pairing it with a static font, for
testing the golang.org/x/image/font/sfnt package's fvar support.
